ChangeLog amnesiac 3.0.x releases

2026.11.24 [version 3.0.1.alpha] [git 54]
- fix mdv so that it correctly honors the channel parameter. //skullY
- fix package naming so /addmod and /delmod work correctly in all situations. //skullY
- Replace the ignore engine with a completed version of hop's EPIC6 script while keeping AMN's user facing behavior. //skullY
- Move relay to modules.broken. It may come back, it may not. //skullY

2026.11.22 [version 3.0.0] [git 53]
- whaaaaaaaaat? new amn release? no way! //skullY
- dict and remote have been removed for now because epic6 doesn't have dcc currently. when it's back in epic6 they'll be back in amn. //skullY
- Remove obsolete DCC settings, hooks, key bindings, formats, and tab completions. Old mod.save files skip unavailable modules, including dict and remote. Regular IRC completion, relay, and logging still work. //skullY
- Load and save existing ignore rules with EPIC6 context filtering. Preserve legacy levels in the saved rules. //skullY
- Keep the saved notify list available offline, subscribe to it on servers that support MONITOR, and log MONITOR replies with nlog. //skullY
- Skip Python initialization when EPIC6 lacks Python support. //skullY
- Preserve userlist mask shorthand and wildcards, and remove obsolete settings, hooks, and the unused sedcrypt helper. //skullY
- Report file operation failures in saves, logs, and readers. Stage replacement saves before updating their destination or backup. //skullY
- Restore automatic reconnect after a server closes the connection, and rejoin saved channels with their keys. //skullY
- Preserve quoted ignore reasons and absolute timeout deadlines across saves and restarts. Skip saved rules that expired while the client was offline. //skullY
- Fix a bug where numeric 366 stalled in line-by-line (dumb) mode because $geom() returns -2147483648. //skullY
- Unset STATUS_MAIL because that moved out to a Python script in epic6 and we don't need to support it directly in amn. //skullY
- Move serverlist to modules.broken. //skullY
- Change all uses of $C to $winchan($serverwin()). //skullY
- Remove executable /eval calls from startup, module loading, AOL usage output, and evalcat. //skullY
